;, &#x27;Behind&#x27;, and &#x27;Behind?&#x27;</p>\n<h2>Suggestion to Go Down</h2>\n<p>Someone suggests going down, as indicated by the quotes &#x27;Let&#x27;s go down&#x27;, &#x27;Let&#x27;s go down&#x27;, and &#x27;Let&#x27;s go down&#x27;.</p>\n<h2>Request for Someone to Come</h2>\n<p>Someone asks if another person can come, as seen in the quote &#x27;Can you come here?&#x27;.</p>\n<h2>Direction Suggestion</h2>\n<p>Someone suggests moving in a specific direction, as indicated by the quotes &#x27;This way?&#x27; and &#x27;This way&#x27;.</p>\n<h2>Stress Due to Tournament Timing</h2>\n<p>The speaker is stressed due to the early timing of the tournament, as stated in the quote &#x27;It was early before the tournament, so I&#x27;m kind of stressed.&#x27;</p>\n<h2>Reassurance</h2>\n<p>The speaker reassures themselves that it&#x27;s okay, as seen in the quote &#x27;But it&#x27;s fine&#x27;.</p>\n<h2>Repetition of Reassurance</h2>\n<p>The speaker repeats that everything is alright, as indicated by the quote &#x27;It&#x27;s fine&#x27;.</p>\n<h2>Confirmation of Reassurance</h2>\n<p>The speaker confirms their feeling of reassurance, as seen in the quote &#x27;It&#x27;s fine&#x27;.</p>\n<h2>Confidence in Team Victory</h2>\n<p>The speaker expresses confidence in their team&#x27;s victory, as stated in the quote &#x27;We will win&#x27;.</p>\n<h2>Agreement with Statement</h2>\n<p>Someone agrees with the speaker&#x27;s statement, as seen in the quote &#x27;Yeah&#x27;.</p>\n<h2>Reassurance Based on Team Size</h2>\n<p>The speaker attempts to reassure themselves by acknowledging the team size, as indicated by the quote &#x27;There&#x27;s a lot of people in the team, so it&#x27;s fine&#x27;.</p>\n<h2>Confirmation of Statement</h2>\n<p>Someone confirms a previous statement, as seen in the quote &#x27;Yes&#x27;.</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tFsZVRkxdsg</p>",
